  lines:
  - id: 0
    category: 0
    variants:
    - There's a device on your body. | Three modules. One timer at a time. When it
      hits zero, it goes off.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 203931a37efb69b4c92da328a289b145, type: 3}
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 1
    category: 0
    variants:
    - 'The rules are simple: solve it, disarm it, get out.'
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8c63bddd07c7f34449bdf54674acfcca, type: 3}
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 2
    category: 0
    variants:
    - You're not alone in the complex anymore. And there's more than time to worry
      about now.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 408be11c093d12a4a8fdc987bc6db6b9, type: 3}
    alert: '> CONTAINMENT BREACH'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 3
    category: 0
    variants:
    - You made it. You're the first.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f8f2cf034356cfe4c9d7582488b79a69, type: 3}
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> {0} DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 1
  - id: 4
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Industrial sector. Three parts of the system to bring back online. Once all
      three are up, you can move on.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: a8ff40e58a1b0e941bce32c5bb55cce9, type: 3}
    alert: '|| Safe Zone || '
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 5
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Down here you'll have to think a little harder before it goes off.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e23a4b3d9165bf4fa5c541eb40624ca, type: 3}
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 6
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Module disarmed. The gate is open. The complex goes on.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: f215e5080b7f66f40908762989631900, type: 3}
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> M1 DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 7
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Two modules down. One left.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: be2327f463e276c4da0d773edb889fa9, type: 3}
    alert: <color=#2EB847>> M2 DISARMED</color>
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 8
    category: 1
    variants:
    - Someone was here before you. They left something for whoever came next.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 637e5c48ba92ac24e84554fd7fdea9c5, type: 3}
    alert: 
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 9
    category: 2
    variants:
    - You're running out of time.
    - Almost.
    - Tick, Tick.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ee036151eb76ac4dbb711880acdc1fc, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9ec9015466b889c46b00819fcd3fbfef, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: d36eef5454276bb45b6d1aa6991cce1e, type: 3}
