    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 10
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The legs. Every step from now on will remind you.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90873633d66157c45b1b023b940ac859, type: 3}
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 11
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The chest. Breathing will cost you more than it used to.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3420bf17fae94c45bf52080cf9e47fc, type: 3}
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 12
    category: 2
    variants:
    - The head. What you see won't always be real from now on.
    clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd4965bda3e3ffd4ca7724f3588224c6, type: 3}
    alert: '> {0} DETONATED'
    playsOverMenus: 0
  - id: 13
    category: 2
    variants:
    - You made it in time.
    - Good.
    clips:
